---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { CaseConverterTool } from "../../components/tools/CaseConverterTool";
---
<BaseLayout title="Case Converter" description="Convert text between common writing and identifier cases locally.">
  <article class="tool-page"><header class="tool-heading"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Workbench</a> / Text</nav><p class="eyebrow">Text</p><h1>Case Converter</h1><p class="lede">Convert prose, headings, and identifiers with an explicit case mode.</p><div class="trust-strip" role="note"><strong>Runs on this device.</strong><span>Your text is not uploaded.</span></div></header><CaseConverterTool client:load /><section class="method-card"><h2>Case modes</h2><ul><li>Lower and upper use JavaScript Unicode-aware casing without locale-specific language data.</li><li>Title, sentence, camel, pascal, kebab, snake, and constant modes derive words from Unicode letters and numbers.</li><li>Original punctuation is not silently interpreted as semantic structure.</li></ul></section></article>
</BaseLayout>
